---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import familyLawImage from '../assets/images/family-law-page.png'; // Using your specific asset
---

<BaseLayout title="Family Law Attorneys | Hanover and Echols">
  <Header />

  <main class="bg-[#02084b] text-white pt-24 pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
      
      <!-- REVISED HERO: Matches family-law-one_2.jpg proportions -->
<div class="flex items-center gap-8 mb-16">
  <img 
    src={familyLawImage.src} 
    alt="Family Law Services" 
    class="w-80 h-auto rounded-lg shadow-xl" 
  />
  <div>
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif mb-2 text-[#00E5FF]">Family Law</h1>
    <h2 class="text-2xl text-slate-300">Compassionate Guidance Through Life's Transitions</h2>
  </div>
</div>

      <!-- CONTENT SECTION -->
      <section class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8">
        <p>Family law matters represent some of the most sensitive and impactful challenges an individual can face in their lifetime. When legal disputes arise within the family unit, the emotional weight can often be overwhelming, making it difficult to maintain clarity while making decisions that will shape your future for years to come. Our team is dedicated to providing a supportive environment where your voice is heard and your rights are aggressively defended. We believe that effective legal counsel in this practice area requires more than just a deep understanding of the statutes; it demands a nuanced approach that considers the long-term well-being of all parties involved, especially when children are part of the process. Our approach is centered on resolving conflicts with both precision and empathy, ensuring that every legal document is drafted with your absolute best interests in mind and that your objectives are prioritized at every stage of the representation process, whether through mediation or litigation.</p>
        
        <p>Navigating the legal landscape of family issues requires an attorney who can balance strength with sophisticated problem-solving skills. We recognize that no two family situations are exactly alike, which is why we reject cookie-cutter approaches in favor of tailored strategies that reflect your unique domestic circumstances and long-term personal goals. Our practice is built on a foundation of proactive communication, ensuring you are never left in the dark regarding the status of your case or the potential implications of strategic decisions. By working closely with our firm, you gain access to a partner who is genuinely invested in your success and stability, helping to alleviate the stress associated with legal proceedings. Whether you are initiating a difficult transition or responding to actions taken against you, our commitment remains steadfast in protecting your financial stability, your parental rights, and your peace of mind throughout the entire process.</p>
        
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-3 text-slate-300">
          <li>Strategic asset protection to ensure your financial future remains secure during division.</li>
          <li>Comprehensive child custody planning that prioritizes the stability and needs of your children.</li>
          <li>Aggressive defense of your parental rights in complex relocation or modification disputes.</li>
          <li>Detailed analysis of support obligations to ensure fairness based on your current capacity.</li>
          <li>Expert mediation services aimed at reducing conflict and resolving issues efficiently.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Beyond the technical aspects of the law, we understand that we are helping you build the foundation for your next chapter. Our lawyers bring extensive experience in handling delicate negotiations, ensuring that your privacy is maintained and that sensitive information is handled with the utmost professional discretion. We prioritize collaborative solutions where possible to minimize conflict, yet we are fully prepared to take your case to court should that become necessary to protect your position. The trust you place in us is not taken lightly; we operate with total transparency, providing clear explanations of all legal options so you can make informed choices with confidence. By maintaining a focus on sustainable outcomes, we help you transition into the next stage of your life with dignity, security, and the legal protections you deserve.</p>
        
        <p>Our firm also recognizes the evolving nature of family law and the importance of staying current with recent legislative changes that could impact your case outcome. We continuously refine our litigation techniques to leverage the most modern strategies available, providing you with a distinct advantage during proceedings. You deserve a team that is not only well-versed in the courtroom but also deeply committed to the personal success of every client we represent in the community. Let us handle the legal complexities, from filings to final hearings, so you can focus on the personal aspects of your life that matter most during this transition. Your path forward starts with a dedicated advocate, and we are ready to stand by your side from the initial consultation through to the final resolution of your family law matter.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- Updated Call to Action linking to the Contact Us page -->
<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-16 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6">
  <a 
    href="/contact-us" 
    class="flex-1 py-5 px-8 rounded-xl bg-[#00E5FF] text-[#010636] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-widest shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(0,229,255,0.3)] hover:bg-[#00E5FF]/80 transition-all"
  >
    Request a Free Case Review
  </a>
  <a 
    href="tel:+14699024621" 
    class="flex-1 py-5 px-8 rounded-xl bg-[#FDD835] text-[#010636] font-bold text-center uppercase tracking-widest shadow-xl hover:bg-[#FDD835]/80 transition-all"
  >
    Call Us Today – +1 469 902 4621
  </a>
</section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>